Meta-port for the Framework laptop Fn row and media keys.  It
installs framework-keyboard(7) and depends on bhotkeys, bosd, and
the six packages those keys run: bhotkeys-airplane, bhotkeys-audio,
bhotkeys-brightness, bhotkeys-media, bhotkeys-mirror, and
bhotkeys-screenshot.

bhotkeys-extend, bhotkeys-lid-state, bhotkeys-lock, bhotkeys-albert,
and framework-autorotate-hotkey are separate ports.  The manual
marks those chords optional.
